   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Omega-3 fatty acids are found largely in colorful fruits and vegetables, as well as in fortified cereals and beverages. Fruits, such as grapes, apples, pears, cherries, and berries; dark chocolate; legumes; red wine; tea; and coffee are also good sources."
    }
